flowchart TB
  subgraph step1 [Step 1 - Pick prompts]
    A[You enter brand + website]
    B[System auto-generates prompts]
    C[Or pulls from real-user query dataset]
    D[Or you add your own prompts]
    A --> E[Saved list of ~35-50 prompts]
    B --> E
    C --> E
    D --> E
  end

  subgraph step2 [Step 2 - Run prompts daily]
    E --> F[Bot opens ChatGPT like a real user]
    F --> G[Types prompt 1 and saves answer]
    F --> H[Types prompt 2 and saves answer]
    F --> I[... repeats for all prompts]
  end

  subgraph step3 [Step 3 - Score results]
    G --> J[Did your brand appear?]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Visibility score = percent of prompts you appear in]
    J --> L[Per-prompt table in dashboard]
    J --> M[Competitors mentioned]
  end